      "writtenOn": "2022-11-18T02:41:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jiyong by this do you mean replace `current` with the value of `SdkVersion().String()`?\n\nI think most droidstubs set `sdk_version\u003dnone`. I wrote a small query and out of the 13 droidstubs modules in the tree, only `hwbinder-stubs-docs` does not set `none` as its sdk_version.\n\n\nIf this follows sdk_version, then SdkNone\u0027s string representation `(no version)` will be passed to the aidl compiler",
      "parentUuid": "2681188e_439bc1a3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 309,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 309,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "f7c0fb8b0e88e2b8447813e45dd530687979e971",
