      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T23:01:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack, I have updated the implementation to use `FinalOrFutureInt`.\n\nIn the updated implementation, min_sdk_version evaluates to `10000` for both these cases\n1. droidstubs that dont set this property (and uses private platform apis)\n2. droidstubs that set `sdk_version: none`, since NoneApiLevel sets `isPreview: true`\n\nFrom the perspective of the aidl compiler, does it need to distinguish (1) from (2)?",
      "parentUuid": "b6d48228_dac86d46",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 309,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 309,
        "endChar": 41
      },
